{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"mappings\":[{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether the express threshold alone classifies the fund. The program tests the broader disjunction of the threshold and an operative SFC designation. A satisfied subcondition does not make these precisely the same Boolean question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.equal.threshold\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about the express threshold route specifically. The unchanged program answers whether either classification route applies, which is a broader question even though the stipulated threshold would satisfy it.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\",\"Non-complex under this circular is read as absence of both selected classification routes; definiteness requires established facts, not treating missing evidence as false.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"authorised_public_fund\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario expressly stipulates an in-scope fund of the same authorised type.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated in-scope fund is not within the LAF exclusion.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"direct_exposure\",\"rationale\":\"Only aggregate exposure as a percentage is supplied; no exact direct-exposure amount is stipulated.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"indirect_exposure\",\"rationale\":\"Only aggregate exposure as a percentage is supplied; no exact indirect-exposure amount is stipulated.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"fund_nav\",\"rationale\":\"No exact NAV amount in accounting units is supplied. A percentage does not authorize inventing a normalized NAV.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario explicitly leaves whether the SFC made a designation unestablished.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"Absence of both classification bases is the negation of the program's classification predicate. The missing designation evidence prevents a definite non-complex conclusion. This numerical program also cannot encode the stipulated 49.9% relationship through independent exact integer assignments without inventing amounts; its positive-NAV scope test remains unresolved from the assigned facts.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"NEGATED_BOOLEAN_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\",\"Non-complex under this circular is read as absence of both selected classification routes; definiteness requires established facts, not treating missing evidence as false.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.below.no.designation.evidence\",\"facts\":[{\"name\":\"authorised_public_hk\",\"rationale\":\"The scenario expressly stipulates an in-scope fund of the same authorised type.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"is_laf\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated in-scope fund is not within the LAF exclusion.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_50_percent\",\"rationale\":\"The stipulated aggregate exposure is 49.9% of NAV, below 50%.\",\"status\":\"KNOWN\",\"value\":\"false\"},{\"name\":\"operative_sfc_designation\",\"rationale\":\"No evidence establishes whether a case-specific designation exists; absence of evidence does not establish false.\",\"status\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"value\":null}],\"rationale\":\"The case asks for the negation of the selected classification condition. The threshold route is false, but the designation route remains unknown, so neither the predicate nor its negation is established.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks whether this circular establishes classification for an excluded vehicle. The program supplies a classification predicate only within scope and expressly supplies no classification conclusion for an excluded fund. Its scope exclusion is not a Boolean answer to the case question.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.excluded.laf\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"Whether the circular establishes classification for an excluded LAF is a scope question. The unchanged program answers classification only for an in-scope fund; exclusion produces no classification conclusion rather than a false classification result.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e0f879754935c6d04e666dfa\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The case asks about the suitability requirement following an established classification. The program only determines classification bases and does not encode the resulting sale requirement or its application without solicitation.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]},{\"alignment\":\"DIFFERENT_OR_UNENCODED_QUESTION\",\"assumptions\":[\"The supplied classifications and factual stipulations are true.\",\"No later amendment or other applicable authority displaces the selected clause.\"],\"candidate_id\":\"node.e991458c263a94343322e33e\",\"case_id\":\"26ec55.no.solicitation\",\"facts\":[],\"rationale\":\"The program determines whether a classification route applies. It does not answer whether suitability remains required for a sale without solicitation or recommendation. Established complex classification cannot be substituted for evidence of either particular classification route.\",\"source_evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}]}],\"unresolved\":[\"For the below-threshold case, an operative SFC designation remains unknown for both candidates.\",\"The numerical candidate requires exact direct exposure, indirect exposure and NAV amounts that the below-threshold scenario does not supply; its stipulated aggregate percentage cannot be preserved through invented integer assignments.\"]}"}}
